### 🔍 1. Iterative Binary Search (Debugging Problem)

#### ❌ Buggy Code:

```c
int binarySearch(int arr[], int n, int key) {
    int low = 0;
    int high = n;  // ❌ BUG: Should be n - 1

    while (low <= high) {
        int mid = (low + high) / 2;

        if (arr[mid] == key)
            return mid;
        else if (arr[mid] < key)
            low = mid + 1;
        else
            high = mid - 1;
    }
    return -1;
}
```

#### ✅ Corrected Code:

```c
int binarySearch(int arr[], int n, int key) {
    int low = 0;
    int high = n - 1;  // ✅ Fixed: last index

    while (low <= high) {
        int mid = (low + high) / 2;

        if (arr[mid] == key)
            return mid;
        else if (arr[mid] < key)
            low = mid + 1;
        else
            high = mid - 1;
    }
    return -1;
}
```

